# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/hollowstar/night.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event hs_the_night_above
# en: Someone Else's Night
title [8f89ac] = 别人的那一夜
# en: You wake in the night to the bell under the lake, tolling and tolling. From your window the whole lake is white, and out on the ice there are lanterns moving in a ring, and figures you can't make out. Somebody runs past your door. Nobody knocks on it.
text [5c6011] = 夜里你被湖底的钟声惊醒，钟声一下接一下。从窗口望去，整片湖都白了，冰面上有一圈提灯在移动，还有你看不清的人影。有人从你门前跑过。没有人敲你的门。
# en: A dormitory window at night, a lake frozen white below, lanterns moving out on the ice, a student watching from behind the glass.
scene [80eae2] = 夜晚的宿舍窗户，窗下的湖冻得雪白，冰面上提灯在移动，一个学生在玻璃后面看着。
# en: Keep the first-years in their beds
opt.left.label [fdfae3] = 让一年级生们待在床上
# en: You sit on the stairs of the first-year tower until dawn with a lamp, saying "go back to bed" forty times. By morning the lake has thawed. Someone else went down with a lantern. You never learn the whole of it.
opt.left.say.1 [a93ea5] = 你提着灯在一年级塔的楼梯上坐到天亮，说了四十遍“回去睡觉”。到早上，湖解冻了。有别人提着灯下去了。你始终没能知道事情的全貌。
# en: Watch from the window
opt.right.label [f8add9] = 在窗边看着
# en: You watch until the lanterns go out, one by one, and then something under the ice glows and goes dark. By morning the lake is blue. At breakfast the headmistress's hair is a shade whiter, and she smiles at nobody.
opt.right.say.1 [7c3b54] = 你一直看到提灯一盏接一盏熄灭，然后冰下有什么东西亮了一下，又暗了。到早上湖是蓝的。早餐时，院长的头发白了一点，她对着空无一人的地方微笑。

@event hs_night_company
# en: Who Comes Down With You
title [be20d9] = 谁陪你下去
# en: The boathouse hatch is open, and the steps go down into blue light. {flag(hs_early): You came without telling anyone, and only the ones who promised have followed you down the shore.|Behind you, people are running across the frozen lawn: the ones who said they'd stand with you, and meant it.} The tunnel down is narrow. There's room for two of you, and no more. Who comes?
text [baa8d6] = 船屋的活板门开着，台阶一路向下，没入蓝光之中。{flag(hs_early): 你没告诉任何人就来了，只有那些许过诺的人沿着湖岸跟了过来。|你身后，有人正跑过结冰的草坪：那些说过会与你并肩、并且是认真的人。}往下的隧道很窄。只容得下你们两个人，不能再多了。谁来？
# en: The boathouse at night, its hatch open on stone steps going down into blue light, a student at the top with a lantern and figures hurrying in behind.
scene [c81373] = 夜里的船屋，活板门开着，石阶通向下方的蓝光，一个学生提着灯站在顶上，身后有人匆匆赶进来。
# en: Kael
opt.kael.label [9735b0] = 凯尔
# en: Hoarfrost beside you in every fight. His mother is on the ice.
opt.kael.hint [b07fec] = 每场战斗他的白霜都在你身边。他母亲就在冰上。
# en: Kael takes the lantern out of your hand without asking. "My family," he says. "My door." Frost runs down the steps ahead of you, so you don't slip.
opt.kael.say.1 [78c9be] = 凯尔没问就从你手里接过了提灯。“我的家族，”他说，“我的门。”霜在你前面沿着台阶铺下去，免得你滑倒。
# en: Ilse
opt.ilse.label [a098fc] = 伊尔泽
# en: Her frost beside you in every fight. Her mother is on the ice.
opt.ilse.hint [984c7c] = 每场战斗她的霜都在你身边。她母亲就在冰上。
# en: Ilse is already on the top step, white furs and a wand like an icicle. "I was raised for this door," she says. "I'd like to see their faces when I close it."
opt.ilse.say.1 [07512f] = 伊尔泽已经站在最上面一级台阶上，一身白裘，魔杖像一根冰柱。“我就是为这扇门被养大的，”她说，“我想看看我关上它的时候，他们是什么表情。”
# en: Old Maud, with Edmund's wand
opt.maud.label [57a7be] = 老莫德，带着埃德蒙的魔杖
# en: No help in a fight. The founders' wall knows her.
opt.maud.hint [9ebd04] = 战斗中帮不上忙。创始者之墙认得她。
# en: Maud comes down the lawn at a pace that should be impossible at eighty-one, Edmund's wand in her fist. "Sixty years," she says. "I'm not missing it twice, dearie."
opt.maud.say.1 [68f710] = 莫德沿着草坪走下来，速度快得不像八十一岁的人，手里攥着埃德蒙的魔杖。“六十年了，”她说，“我可不能再错过一次，亲爱的。”
# en: The headmistress
opt.isolde.label [fc1c54] = 院长
# en: No help in a fight. Her seal beside yours at the door.
opt.isolde.hint [54b7a5] = 战斗中帮不上忙。在门前，她的封缄与你的并肩。
# en: The headmistress walks into the boathouse as if into her own study, her ring lit like a lamp. "After you," she says. "I've read about this door all my life."
opt.isolde.say.1 [f7868c] = 院长走进船屋，像走进自己的书房，她的戒指亮得像一盏灯。“你先请，”她说，“这扇门我读了一辈子。”
# en: No one. Keep them safe above.
opt.alone.label [6c5427] = 谁也不带。让他们在上面平安。
# en: Every fight is yours alone. Nobody you love goes under the lake.
opt.alone.hint [4ded4f] = 每场战斗都只有你自己。你爱的人没有一个会下到湖底。
# en: You tell them to guard the towers, and close the hatch on their protests. The steps are slick and the dark is very quiet, and it's the bravest and loneliest thing you've ever done.
opt.alone.say.1 [895e06] = 你让他们去守塔，不顾他们的抗议关上了活板门。台阶很滑，黑暗非常安静，这是你做过的最勇敢、也最孤独的事。

@event hs_night_cult
# en: The Circle on the Ice
title [e57069] = 冰上的圆圈
# en: The tunnel comes up through the ice inside a ring of lanterns: twelve figures in black furs, chanting{flag(hs_early): , and half the lanterns not yet lit|}. At the centre stands a tall woman in white with Kael's face, thirty years on. Madame Dumont. {flag(night_kael): "My son. You came after all." Kael's frost hits the ice like a shout.|{flag(night_ilse): "Ilse," she says, the way you'd call a dog. Ilse goes white to the lips.|"Kael's little friend," she says. "Step aside."}}
text [3a8db6] = 隧道从一圈提灯中间穿出冰面：十二个穿黑裘的人影在吟诵{flag(hs_early): ，一半的提灯还没点亮|}。正中站着一个穿白衣的高个子女人，长着凯尔的脸，只是老了三十岁。杜蒙夫人。{flag(night_kael): “我的儿子。你到底还是来了。”凯尔的霜像一声怒吼砸在冰上。|{flag(night_ilse): “伊尔泽。”她说，像在唤一条狗。伊尔泽的嘴唇都白了。|“凯尔的小朋友，”她说，“让开。”}}
# en: A ring of figures in black furs with lanterns on a frozen lake at night, and at its centre a tall woman in white furs with a pale, proud face, her wand raised.
scene [3ccb55] = 夜里结冰的湖面上，一圈穿黑裘、提着灯的人影，正中一个穿白裘的高个子女人，面容苍白而骄傲，举着魔杖。
# en: Break the circle by force
opt.fight.label [2d477d] = 用武力打破圆圈
# en: Combat against her{flag(hs_early): . Half her circle isn't here.|.}
opt.fight.hint [3b6088] = 与她战斗{flag(hs_early): 。她的圆圈有一半人还没来。|。}
# en: Her ward breaks and she goes down on one knee on the ice, and the chant stops dead. She looks up at you with Kael's eyes. "So this is what he chose," she says. The circle scatters into the dark, carrying her.
opt.fight.say.1 [6398c9] = 她的护界碎了，她单膝跪在冰上，吟诵戛然而止。她用凯尔的眼睛抬头看着你。“原来他选的是这个。”她说。圆圈四散进黑暗，把她也带走了。
# en: She doesn't even look at you as she throws you across the ice. "Go down, then," she says. "The door will have you either way." The chant goes on, louder, and the glow under the ring grows.
opt.fight.say.2 [595829] = 她连看都没看你，就把你扔过了冰面。“那就下去吧，”她说，“不管怎样，那扇门都会要你。”吟诵继续，越来越响，圆圈下的光越来越亮。
# en: Speak the names from the Codex
opt.names.label [997c36] = 念出《空洞名录》上的名字
# en: Lore. {clue(codex_names): You've read them.|You'll have to read them off their furs.}
opt.names.hint [4df2c2] = 学识。{clue(codex_names): 你读过它们。|你得从他们的毛皮上读出来。}
# en: You say their names aloud, the ones from the Codex's first page, one for each of them. Each name you say stops a mouth. When you reach "Dumont", the woman in white stops chanting, and the ring of lanterns goes out.
opt.names.say.1 [ef6ec0] = 你大声念出他们的名字，《空洞名录》第一页上的那些，一人一个。每念出一个名字，就有一张嘴停下来。念到“杜蒙”时，白衣女人停止了吟诵，那一圈提灯熄灭了。
# en: You lose your place halfway down the list, and the ones you haven't named say yours back. Your fingertips go grey with cold. The circle closes again behind you as you run for the tunnel.
opt.names.say.2 [66a5a4] = 念到一半你找不到念到哪儿了，那些你还没念到的人，反过来念出了你的名字。你的指尖冻得发灰。你朝隧道跑去时，圆圈在你身后重新合拢。
# en: Their names are stitched into the hems of their furs, the way the Codex lists them. You read them off one by one as they turn, and each name you say stops a mouth. At "Dumont", the woman in white falls silent.
opt.names.say.3 [30ec45] = 他们的名字绣在毛皮的下摆上，排列方式和《空洞名录》一样。他们转身时你一个一个读出来，每念出一个名字，就有一张嘴停下来。念到“杜蒙”时，白衣女人沉默了。
# en: You can read the names stitched in their furs, but not fast enough. Half of them say yours back, and your fingertips go grey with cold. You run for the tunnel with the chant at your back.
opt.names.say.4 [b5d586] = 你读得出他们毛皮上绣的名字，可是不够快。有一半人反过来念出了你的名字，你的指尖冻得发灰。你在背后的吟诵声中跑向隧道。
# en: Let them answer their mother
opt.family.label [43e939] = 让他们回答自己的母亲
# en: Charm. Say what she sent them for, and what they chose.
opt.family.hint [b47c8d] = 魅力。说出她送他们来是为了什么，以及他们选择了什么。
# en: You start it, and then you stop, because {flag(night_kael): Kael|Ilse} is shouting, at last, everything twenty years kept in: the door, the cold house, "well done", never once. The circle wavers. The chant breaks. Madame Dumont lowers her wand and says nothing at all.
opt.family.say.1 [f0a744] = 你开了个头，然后停下了，因为{flag(night_kael): 凯尔|伊尔泽}终于喊了出来，二十年憋在心里的一切：那扇门，那座冰冷的房子，“做得好”，一次都没有。圆圈动摇了。吟诵断了。杜蒙夫人放下魔杖，一句话也没说。
# en: She lets them shout, and then says, quite gently, "Are you finished?" {flag(night_kael): Kael|Ilse} is shaking. The circle goes on chanting as if nobody had spoken, and you drag your friend down the tunnel before the ice opens.
opt.family.say.2 [2d20a0] = 她任由他们喊，然后非常温和地说：“说完了吗？”{flag(night_kael): 凯尔|伊尔泽}在发抖。圆圈继续吟诵，好像谁也没说过话，你在冰面裂开之前把你的朋友拖进了隧道。
# en: Go round the circle
opt.round.label [a3b7a0] = 绕过圆圈
# en: Guile. You'll get past. They'll still be chanting.
opt.round.hint [179df9] = 诡计。你过得去。他们会继续吟诵。
# en: You go round the outside of the ring, low, in the dark between the lanterns, and nobody turns. At the tunnel mouth you look back. She is looking straight at you, and she smiles, and doesn't stop chanting.
opt.round.say.1 [8ff38a] = 你压低身子，在提灯之间的黑暗里绕着圆圈外沿走，没有人回头。到了隧道口你回头看。她正直直地看着你，笑了，没有停止吟诵。
# en: A lantern swings your way, and the woman in white says a word, and the ice bucks under your feet. You reach the tunnel on your hands and knees, with the cold all the way into your chest.
opt.round.say.2 [b159d4] = 一盏提灯朝你晃过来，白衣女人说了一个字，冰面在你脚下猛地一拱。你手脚并用地爬到隧道，寒气一直灌进胸口。

@event hs_night_ilse
# en: Ilse in the Dark
title [9ab9ac] = 黑暗中的伊尔泽
# en: Where the tunnel opens into the dark, Ilse is standing in the way. Her eyes are on nothing, and frost is falling from her hands like flour. "Go back," she says, in the man in grey's pleasant voice, not her own. "This is my door. I was raised for it." {flag(night_kael): Kael says her name. Then he shouts it, and it echoes all the way down.|}
text [7d1eba] = 在隧道通向黑暗的地方，伊尔泽挡在路上。她的眼睛望着虚空，霜像面粉一样从她手里落下。“回去，”她说，用的是灰衣人和气的声音，不是她自己的，“这是我的门。我就是为它被养大的。”{flag(night_kael): 凯尔叫了她的名字。然后他喊了出来，一路回荡到底。|}
# en: A young woman in white furs standing in a dark tunnel under ice, eyes empty, frost falling from her hands like flour.
scene [872d27] = 冰下黑暗的隧道里站着一个穿白裘的年轻女人，眼神空洞，霜像面粉一样从她手中落下。
# en: Reach her
opt.reach.label [0ea9b7] = 唤回她
# en: Charm. What she was raised for, and who she is, are your words.
opt.reach.hint [b945ff] = 魅力。她是为什么被养大的，她是谁，就是你要说的话。
# en: You tell her what she told you once in the snow: that nobody asked her. Her eyes find yours. Then she's crying, furiously, and the frost stops falling. "I can hear him," she says. "I can't hear him any more." {flag(night_kael): Kael gets to her first.|}
opt.reach.say.1 [716271] = 你把她曾在雪地里对你说的话告诉她：从来没人问过她。她的目光找到了你。然后她哭了，哭得很凶，霜不再落下。“我能听见他，”她说，“我听不见他了。”{flag(night_kael): 凯尔先冲到了她身边。|}
# en: She listens to every word with the man in grey's polite face, and steps aside to let you pass. When you look back, she is walking up the tunnel toward her mother's circle, and doesn't turn round.
opt.reach.say.2 [83f591] = 她顶着灰衣人那张客气的脸听完了每一个字，然后让到一边让你过去。你回头看时，她正沿着隧道往上走，走向她母亲的圆圈，没有回头。
# en: Break his hold on her
opt.fight.label [704415] = 打破他对她的控制
# en: Combat, against her. Win, and the compulsion breaks.
opt.fight.hint [d2b22a] = 战斗，对手是她。赢了，强令就会破除。
# en: Your last spell hits the frost in her hands, not her, and it shatters, and so does whatever was holding her. She sits down hard on the tunnel floor. "That hurt," she says, in her own voice, and then, "Thank you," and then she gets up.
opt.fight.say.1 [2db22b] = 你最后一道咒打中的是她手里的霜，不是她，霜碎了，控制着她的东西也碎了。她重重地坐在隧道地上。“好疼。”她用自己的声音说，然后说“谢谢”，然后站了起来。
# en: She fights like what she was raised to be. When you get up, she's gone, up the tunnel toward the ice, and there's a single white glove on the stone.
opt.fight.say.2 [2a6909] = 她打起来就是他们把她养成的样子。等你爬起来，她已经走了，沿着隧道朝冰面去了，石头上留着一只白手套。
# en: Go past her
opt.past.label [ac9e6a] = 从她身边走过
# en: She won't stop you. She won't come with you.
opt.past.hint [51b93f] = 她不会拦你。她也不会跟你走。
# en: You step round her. She doesn't stop you; she doesn't see you. {flag(night_kael): Kael stands with her a moment longer, then comes after you with his jaw set and doesn't speak again until the wall.|You don't look back. You'll think about not looking back for a long time.}
opt.past.say.1 [d9f80e] = 你从她身边绕过去。她没有拦你；她看不见你。{flag(night_kael): 凯尔在她身边多站了一会儿，然后咬着牙跟上你，直到那面墙前都没再说话。|你没有回头。你会在很长时间里想着自己没有回头这件事。}

@event hs_night_shadow
# en: Your Own Shadow
title [39a1da] = 你自己的影子
# en: At the founders' wall your lantern throws your shadow onto the black stone, and it stays there when you stop. Then it turns round. It has your face, and the Star's eyes. {clue(second_shadow): Seraphine painted this. You knew it was coming.|Nobody warned you. Nobody could have.} "Let me in," it says, in your voice. "We'd be so much stronger."
text [d98f1f] = 在创始者之墙前，你的提灯把你的影子投在黑石上，你停下时它没有跟着停下。然后它转过身来。它长着你的脸，和星的眼睛。{clue(second_shadow): 瑟拉芬画过这一幕。你知道它会来。|没有人警告过你。也没有人能警告你。}“让我进去，”它用你的声音说，“我们会强大得多。”
# en: A black stone wall at the end of a tunnel, a student's shadow standing out from the wall on its own, with the student's face and eyes like holes.
scene [323bd5] = 隧道尽头的一面黑石墙，一个学生的影子独自从墙上站出来，长着那个学生的脸，眼睛像两个洞。
# en: Fight it
opt.fight.label [533b96] = 和它战斗
# en: Combat, against everything you know.
opt.fight.hint [54444d] = 战斗，对手是你会的一切。
# en: It fights with your spells, in your order, and it is a beat late, every time, the way it was on the stairs. You use the beat. It breaks against the wall like water, and your own shadow lies down on the floor where it belongs.
opt.fight.say.1 [c202ed] = 它用你的咒语、按你的顺序战斗，每一次都慢了半拍，就像在楼梯上那样。你利用了这半拍。它像水一样在墙上撞碎，你自己的影子躺回了它该在的地上。
# en: It knows every spell you're going to cast, because you do. It puts you on the floor, then sinks back into the wall and waits there, smiling with your mouth.
opt.fight.say.2 [7695cf] = 你要施的每一道咒它都知道，因为你知道。它把你放倒在地，然后沉回墙里，在那里等着，用你的嘴微笑。
# en: Hold up a star's light
opt.light.label [3f402c] = 举起一颗星的光
# en: Arcana. Light the Star can't swallow; Starlight helps.
opt.light.hint [eef3d3] = 奥术。星吞不下的光；星光会有帮助。
# en: You call down the light of a named star into your hand, and the shadow has nowhere to stand. It shrinks back into your outline on the floor with a sound like a sigh, and stays there.
opt.light.say.1 [5b564a] = 你把一颗有名字的星的光唤到手中，影子无处立足。它叹息般地缩回你在地上的轮廓里，再也没出来。
# en: The light comes, and wavers, and the shadow simply steps into the dark behind it. It is still there on the wall when you go on, a moment late behind you, all the way to the door.
opt.light.say.2 [f2e003] = 光来了，摇曳着，影子只是退进光背后的黑暗里。你继续前行时它还在墙上，比你慢半拍地跟着，一直跟到门前。
# en: Let it back in
opt.let.label [16d56d] = 让它回到你身体里
# en: It fits. That's the trouble.
opt.let.hint [80ee89] = 它很合适。麻烦就在这里。
# en: You open your arms and it steps into you, and it fits, it fits so well. You've never felt so strong, or so certain, or so cold. {flag(night_kael): Kael takes a step back from you, and doesn't know he's done it.|}
opt.let.say.1 [d83953] = 你张开双臂，它走进了你，那么合适，合适极了。你从没觉得这么强大，这么笃定，这么冰冷。{flag(night_kael): 凯尔从你身边后退了一步，自己都没察觉。|}

@event hs_aftermath_bargain
# en: The Star's Gift
title [75e568] = 星的馈赠
# en: You wake with the Star's gift already in you. Eclipse, a spell you never studied, sits in your hands like an old habit. There's a purse on your pillow heavy with coins nobody gave you. The mark on your palm has grown a crown of points, and a voice at the back of your mind says, pleasantly, "Good morning."
text [665cc7] = 你醒来时，星的馈赠已经在你身上了。蚀，一道你从没学过的咒语，像老习惯一样待在你手里。你枕头上放着一个钱袋，沉甸甸的，装着没人给过你的硬币。你掌心的印记长出了一圈冠冕般的尖角，脑海深处有个声音和气地说：“早上好。”
# en: A student at a dormitory mirror at dawn, a crowned black star glowing on their palm, a purse spilling coins on the bed behind them.
scene [c5bba3] = 黎明时分，一个学生站在宿舍镜前，掌心一颗戴冠的黑星在发光，身后床上的钱袋里撒出了硬币。
# en: Use it
opt.left.label [77da81] = 用它
# en: The Star likes to be used.
opt.left.hint [d870af] = 星喜欢被使用。
# en: You light every candle in your room with a look, and then put them all out with another. It's easy. It's so easy. Somewhere under the lake, something settles in to wait for what it's owed.
opt.left.say.1 [29757d] = 你看一眼就点亮了房间里所有的蜡烛，再看一眼又把它们全熄灭了。很容易。太容易了。在湖底某处，有什么东西安顿下来，等着收它应得的那份。
# en: Hide the mark
opt.right.label [e267a7] = 藏起印记
# en: Gloves, in spring. People will ask.
opt.right.hint [b0fe59] = 春天戴手套。会有人问的。
# en: You wear gloves from that day on. People ask, and you say it's a burn, and it is, in a way. At night the crown on your palm glows through the leather, and you lie awake watching it.
opt.right.say.1 [f929a7] = 从那天起你一直戴着手套。有人问，你就说是烫伤，某种意义上也确实是。夜里你掌心的冠冕透过皮革发着光，你躺着睁眼看它。

@event hs_aftermath_freed
# en: Every Candle Out
title [e4b25d] = 烛火尽灭
# en: Every candle in Lumenhold went out at midnight and didn't come back until dawn. The lake is blue and empty and very deep. On your pillow there's a letter with a black-star seal: "The families thank you. Your seat at our table is waiting." Across the hall at breakfast, the headmistress looks at you once, and then never again.
text [951287] = 午夜时分，流明堡的每一支蜡烛都熄灭了，直到黎明才重新亮起。湖是蓝的，空的，深不见底。你枕头上有一封黑星封蜡的信：“诸家族感谢你。我们席上为你留着座位。”早餐时，院长隔着大厅看了你一眼，此后再也没看过你。
# en: An academy at dawn with every window dark, students on the lawns staring at an empty sky, a black-sealed letter in one student's hand.
scene [4fbffd] = 黎明时分的学院，每扇窗都是黑的，学生们站在草坪上望着空荡荡的天空，一个学生手里拿着一封黑色封蜡的信。
# en: Answer the letter
opt.left.label [c83974] = 回信
# en: They'd be glad of you.
opt.left.hint [9280b9] = 他们会很高兴有你。
# en: You write back, and a purse comes by the next barge, and after that a letter every month in that beautiful hand. They call you "herald". You find, a little more each time, that you answer to it.
opt.left.say.1 [daba25] = 你回了信，下一班驳船就送来一个钱袋，此后每个月都有一封那样漂亮笔迹的信。他们称你为“使者”。你发现，每多一次，你就更习惯应这个称呼。
# en: Burn it
opt.right.label [162285] = 烧掉它
# en: What's done stays done.
opt.right.hint [ebca83] = 做过的事，就是做过了。
# en: The letter burns blue. It doesn't change anything, and you knew it wouldn't, and you burn the next one too, and the one after that. They keep coming.
opt.right.say.1 [86a907] = 信烧成了蓝色。这改变不了什么，你也知道改变不了，下一封你也烧了，再下一封也是。它们还是不断地来。

@event hs_aftermath_fled
# en: The Door Left Ajar
title [8b2193] = 虚掩的门
# en: The headmistress went down after you ran, and came back up at dawn with her hair gone white. The door is still ajar, she says, but it will hold, for now, with the Wardens sitting up beside it in shifts. She doesn't ask why you ran. That's worse.
text [390b09] = 你跑了之后，院长下去了，黎明时上来，头发全白了。她说那扇门还虚掩着，但暂时撑得住，守望者们轮班坐在它旁边守着。她没有问你为什么跑。这更糟。
# en: A tall woman with newly white hair standing at a window above a lake, a student in the doorway behind her, neither speaking.
scene [cd8f2f] = 一个头发刚刚变白的高个子女人站在湖上方的窗前，一个学生站在她身后的门口，两人都不说话。
# en: "I'm sorry."
opt.left.label [c7fcad] = “对不起。”
# en: "Everyone runs, the first time," she says. "Most don't come back down. You may yet." She gives you a silver ring without a word, and a rota with your name on it, and you take both.
opt.left.say.1 [4c29ee] = “第一次，谁都会跑，”她说，“大多数人不会再下去。你也许会。”她一言不发地给了你一枚银戒指，还有一张写着你名字的值班表，你两样都接下了。
# en: Say nothing
opt.right.label [d1151d] = 什么也不说
# en: You stand in her doorway until she turns back to the window. Every night after that, you dream of the gap between the door and the frame, and the dark looking out of it, and what you'd say to it if you went back.
opt.right.say.1 [71038c] = 你在她门口站着，直到她转回窗前。此后的每一夜，你都梦见门与门框之间的那道缝，梦见从缝里向外看的黑暗，梦见如果你回去会对它说什么。
